**Known for**: Shopify (co-founder & CEO), Ruby on Rails (core team)

Tobias is a billionaire and personal friend of
[David Heinemeier Hansson]($link.page('weird-guys').unsafeRef('dhh')), and
raced as part of his team for Era Motorsport.[[source]][0] He has a 40%
controlling interest in Shopify.[[source]][1]

Tobias defended Shopify's choice to platform (and therefore directly
financially support) far-right tabloid Breitbart in 2017,[[source]][2] citing
freedom of speech and resisting the idea of implementing a "moral code" for
Shopify clients. He also endorsed a proposal to strip retirees of voting rights
and make votes proportional to wealth.[[source]][3]

